@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7F8F4
skinparam noteBorderColor #8E9589
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #555C53
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F4F5F1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #E5E9E0
skinparam ArrowColor #555C53
hide empty members
title B02 类图 · 订单、日售、报价与实体房

class "Reservation" as Reservation <<记录>> {
  id, customer_id, guest_name
  state, version, deadline
  total
}
class "StayPlan" as Stay <<值>> {
  typeId, arrival, departure
  quantity, guests
  nights
  cutoff
}
class "BookedNight" as Booked <<记录>> {
  order_id, night
  unit
}
class "DayOffer" as Offer <<记录>> {
  type_id, night
  capacity, reserved
  price, stopped
}
class "RoomAssignment" as Assignment <<记录>> {
  order_id, room_id
  checked_in, checked_out
}
class "Room" as Room <<记录>> {
  id, type_id
  number, state
}
class "PriceQuote" as Quote <<值>> {
  plan, prices, available
  total, item
}
class "Submission" as Submission <<记录>> {
  customer_id, key
  fingerprint, result
}

Reservation "1" *-down- "1" Stay : 当前行程
Reservation "1" *-down- "1..*" Booked : 成交记录
Reservation "1" *-down- "0..*" Assignment : 入住分配历史
Booked "*" --> "1" Offer : 房型与住宿日
Assignment "*" --> "1" Room : 实体房号
Quote ..> Stay : 报价绑定
Submission ..> Reservation : 成功结果指向
Stay -[hidden]right- Booked
Booked -[hidden]right- Assignment

note bottom of Stay
占用范围为 [入住日, 退房日).
每个住宿日按间数 q 检查和占用.
行程从订单的日期、间数及房型恢复.
end note
note left of Quote
持久报价绑定顾客及行程;
改期报价另外绑定订单版本.
过期后重新报价.
end note
note bottom of Assignment
活动分配的房号互异.
入住时一次提交 q 个房号.
end note
@enduml
